function checkObjective(){if(!axeBuilt){$('#objectiveTitle').textContent='Make a foothold';$('#objectiveText').textContent=bag.wood>=2&&bag.stone>=2?'Enough salvage for a stone axe. Open fieldcraft with Q.':'Search the wreckage for driftwood and stones, then craft a stone axe.'}else if(!fireBuilt){$('#objectiveTitle').textContent='Make a foothold';$('#objectiveText').textContent='Craft a campfire to make a safe place to cook and recover.'}else if(!raftBuilt){$('#objectiveTitle').textContent='Beyond the reef';$('#objectiveText').textContent='Gather more driftwood and vines to craft a reef skiff.'}else{$('#objectiveTitle').textContent='The Three Lights';$('#objectiveText').textContent='Your skiff is ready. Head out to discover the neighboring islands.'}}
const keys={};
addEventListener('keydown',e=>{keys[e.code]=true;if(['Space','ArrowUp','ArrowDown'].includes(e.code))e.preventDefault();if(e.repeat)return;if(e.code==='KeyE')interact();if(e.code==='KeyQ'&&!$('#intro').classList.contains('open')){drawRecipes();panel('#craftPanel',!$('#craftPanel').classList.contains('open'))}if(e.code==='Escape'){panel('#craftPanel',false);panel('#notePanel',false)}if(e.code==='Space'&&isSwimming){diving=!diving;toast(diving?'Diving below the surface':'Breaking the surface');}});
addEventListener('keyup',e=>keys[e.code]=false);
$('#begin').onclick=()=>{$('#intro').classList.remove('open');started=true;toast('Find the wreck · salvage driftwood and stone');};
document.querySelectorAll('[data-close]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>{panel('#craftPanel',false);panel('#notePanel',false)});
renderer.domElement.addEventListener('pointerdown',e=>{mouseDown=true;lastX=e.clientX;lastY=e.clientY;renderer.domElement.setPointerCapture(e.pointerId)});
renderer.domElement.addEventListener('pointerup',()=>mouseDown=false);
renderer.domElement.addEventListener('pointermove',e=>{if(!mouseDown)return;const dx=e.clientX-lastX,dy=e.clientY-lastY;lastX=e.clientX;lastY=e.clientY;yaw-=dx*.004;pitch=Math.max(-.12,Math.min(.62,pitch+dy*.003));});
$('#touchAction').addEventListener('click',interact);let touchDir={x:0,z:0};$('#touchMove').addEventListener('touchstart',e=>{e.preventDefault();touchDir.z=-1},{passive:false});$('#touchMove').addEventListener('touchend',()=>touchDir={x:0,z:0});
function findNearest(){let best=3.5;nearest=null;for(const r of resources){if(!r.visible)continue;const d=Math.hypot(player.position.x-r.x,player.position.z-r.z);if(d<best){best=d;nearest=r}}const p=$('#prompt');if(nearest){p.innerHTML=`<b>E</b> &nbsp; ${nearest.type==='note'?'Read survivor note':nearest.type==='tree'?'Harvest palm':nearest.type==='rock'?'Break stone':`Collect ${nearest.name.toLowerCase()}`}`;p.style.opacity=1}else if(isSwimming){p.innerHTML=`<b>E</b> &nbsp; ${diving?'Spear a reef fish':'Dive to explore the reef'}`;p.style.opacity=1}else p.style.opacity=0;}
function updateAnimals(dt){for(const a of animals){const d=Math.hypot(player.position.x-a.x,player.position.z-a.z);if(a.kind==='boar'&&d<7){a.state='charge';const ang=Math.atan2(player.position.x-a.x,player.position.z-a.z);a.x+=Math.sin(ang)*dt*3.2;a.z+=Math.cos(ang)*dt*3.2;if(d<1.6){stats.health=Math.max(0,stats.health-dt*7)}}else{a.state=d<11?'alert':'idle';a.seed+=dt;if(Math.random()<dt*.18){a.x+=(Math.random()-.5)*1.3;a.z+=(Math.random()-.5)*1.3}}a.x=Math.max(-33,Math.min(33,a.x));a.z=Math.max(-28,Math.min(28,a.z));a.group.position.set(a.x,heightAt(a.x,a.z),a.z);a.group.rotation.y=Math.sin(elapsed*.7+a.seed)*.1;if(a.kind==='boar'&&d<8)a.group.rotation.y=Math.atan2(player.position.x-a.x,player.position.z-a.z)}}
function update(dt){if(!started)return;elapsed+=dt;const paused=$('#craftPanel').classList.contains('open')||$('#notePanel').classList.contains('open');
if(!paused){const forward=(keys.KeyW||keys.ArrowUp?1:0)-(keys.KeyS||keys.ArrowDown?1:0),side=(keys.KeyD||keys.ArrowRight?1:0)-(keys.KeyA||keys.ArrowLeft?1:0),run=!!(keys.ShiftLeft||keys.ShiftRight)&&stats.stamina>2;const speed=(isSwimming?2.45:run?6.2:3.6);if(forward||side){const dir=new THREE.Vector3(Math.sin(yaw),0,Math.cos(yaw));const right=new THREE.Vector3(dir.z,0,-dir.x);player.position.addScaledVector(dir,-forward*speed*dt);player.position.addScaledVector(right,side*speed*dt);player.rotation.y=yaw+(side?Math.atan2(side,Math.max(.1,forward)):0)}
const radial=Math.hypot(player.position.x,player.position.z);isSwimming=radial>36.2;const ground=heightAt(player.position.x,player.position.z);if(isSwimming){if(diving)player.position.y=Math.max(-2.2,player.position.y-dt*1.1);else player.position.y+=(.38-player.position.y)*Math.min(1,dt*4);stats.oxygen=Math.max(0,stats.oxygen-dt*(diving?7:2));if(stats.oxygen<=0){stats.health=Math.max(0,stats.health-dt*8);diving=false}}else{diving=false;player.position.y=ground;if(stats.oxygen<100)stats.oxygen=Math.min(100,stats.oxygen+dt*28)}stats.stamina=Math.min(100,stats.stamina+(run&&(forward||side)?-dt*12:dt*8));stats.hunger=Math.max(0,stats.hunger-dt*.045);stats.thirst=Math.max(0,stats.thirst-dt*.072);if(stats.thirst<5||stats.hunger<5)stats.health=Math.max(0,stats.health-dt*1.2);if(stats.health<=0){toast('You are exhausted · return to the beach to recover');stats.health=35;stats.thirst=35;stats.hunger=35;player.position.set(0,heightAt(0,18),18)}updateAnimals(dt);findNearest();}
const time=elapsed/180, daylight=.5+.5*Math.sin(time*Math.PI*2-Math.PI/2);sun.intensity=2.2+daylight*1.7;sun.position.set(-45+Math.sin(time*6)*12,35+daylight*45,25);scene.background.setHSL(.52,.27,.39+daylight*.17);scene.fog.color.copy(scene.background);$('#weather').textContent=`ISLAND TIME · ${String(8+Math.floor(elapsed/55)%12).padStart(2,'0')}:${String(Math.floor(elapsed*1.1)%60).padStart(2,'0')}`;$('#compass').innerHTML=`${Math.abs(yaw)<.7?'N':yaw>0?'W':'E'} &nbsp; · &nbsp; FAIRESTATLE`;
